license: GPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - plasmid
  - phage
  - chromosome
  - replicon classification
  - machine learning
abstract: >-
  MobiOrigin is a CPU-oriented sequence-and-marker classifier that assigns
  bacterial DNA fragments to chromosome, plasmid, phage, or an explicit
  unclassified state. Version 0.1.0 packages the frozen three-seed dev1 model
  evaluated in a prospective external comparison with geNomad.
